WEBVTT

1
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.958
At the close of Chapter 9,
Lord Krishna revealed

2
00:00:39.958 --> 00:00:45.125
the most secret teaching
of pure devotional service.

3
00:00:45.125 --> 00:00:48.166
Now He takes this knowledge further

4
00:00:48.166 --> 00:00:49.791
and in Chapter 10

5
00:00:49.791 --> 00:00:53.375
His divine glories He describes in detail.

6
00:00:53.375 --> 00:00:54.333
Why?

7
00:00:54.333 --> 00:00:58.500
So that Arjun's devotion may
deepen even further.

8
00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:04.541
Lord Krishna

9
00:01:04.541 --> 00:01:08.041
addresses Arjun as 'Mahabahu' –

10
00:01:08.041 --> 00:01:11.666
'the mighty-armed one.' This address reflects

11
00:01:11.666 --> 00:01:13.583
Arjun's strength, not just on the battlefield,

12
00:01:13.583 --> 00:01:16.875
but in understanding deep spiritual truths.

13
00:01:16.875 --> 00:01:19.375
Lord Krishna declares

14
00:01:19.375 --> 00:01:22.250
that He will share 'paramam vachah,'

15
00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:25.791
the supreme teaching.

16
00:01:25.791 --> 00:01:28.375
This is the essence of all knowledge.

17
00:01:28.375 --> 00:01:30.083
This knowledge is special,

18
00:01:30.083 --> 00:01:32.333
especially for Arjun,

19
00:01:32.333 --> 00:01:36.958
whom Lord Krishna considers
as His dear friend, 'priyamanaya'.

20
00:01:36.958 --> 00:01:39.333
Lord Krishna's incomparable glories

21
00:01:39.333 --> 00:01:41.166
and the knowledge of His divine nature –

22
00:01:41.166 --> 00:01:43.500
what happens when one understands this?

23
00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:46.333
The devotee comes to know
Lord Krishna's greatness.

24
00:01:46.333 --> 00:01:48.666
Love for Lord Krishna grows,

25
00:01:48.666 --> 00:01:51.833
and gratitude deepens.

26
00:01:51.833 --> 00:01:52.916
Just as of a friend's

27
00:01:52.916 --> 00:01:54.750
hidden talent on learning

28
00:01:54.750 --> 00:01:57.625
your respect grows –
in the same way, Lord Krishna's

29
00:01:57.625 --> 00:02:00.083
infinite powers on knowing

30
00:02:00.083 --> 00:02:01.958
devotion grows.

31
00:02:01.958 --> 00:02:03.583
Lord Krishna's use

32
00:02:03.583 --> 00:02:06.208
of the word 'bhuyah' – 'again'
– the glory of devotion

33
00:02:06.208 --> 00:02:10.375
to describe again and again,
His eagerness reveals.

34
00:02:10.375 --> 00:02:12.958
It proves that the path of devotion

35
00:02:12.958 --> 00:02:17.125
is boundlessly rich and endlessly rewarding.

36
00:02:17.125 --> 00:02:18.083
This verse

37
00:02:18.083 --> 00:02:21.166
also reveals Lord Krishna's reciprocity.

38
00:02:21.166 --> 00:02:23.125
He speaks out of affection,

39
00:02:23.125 --> 00:02:25.708
with the desire to uplift Arjun.

40
00:02:25.708 --> 00:02:28.166
This to devotees always reminds

41
00:02:28.166 --> 00:02:30.083
that Lord Krishna's guidance,

42
00:02:30.083 --> 00:02:33.750
for the devotees' welfare, for spiritual growth,

43
00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:37.000
comes from the deep care of His heart.

44
00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:39.500
In summary, in the coming verses, the Lord

45
00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:42.541
sets the stage for a discourse

46
00:02:42.541 --> 00:02:45.708
that will not only reveal His greatness,

47
00:02:45.708 --> 00:02:49.250
but will also give all seekers the transformative

48
00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:52.250
power of devotion to experience.

49
00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:01.500
This thought must have come
to your mind many times –

50
00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:03.250
that in the Gita

51
00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:06.500
about Myself

52
00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:08.666
why do I speak so much?

53
00:03:08.666 --> 00:03:13.166
Is it for My own praise?

54
00:03:13.166 --> 00:03:14.500
No,

55
00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:16.416
not at all.

56
00:03:16.416 --> 00:03:20.708
My purpose is very simple –

57
00:03:20.708 --> 00:03:23.875
your upliftment.

58
00:03:23.875 --> 00:03:28.666
I describe My glory

59
00:03:28.666 --> 00:03:30.791
so that you may be inspired,

60
00:03:30.791 --> 00:03:34.041
so that you may be guided,

61
00:03:34.041 --> 00:03:36.208
and so that you may be assured,

62
00:03:36.208 --> 00:03:41.541
knowing that one of infinite power

63
00:03:41.541 --> 00:03:46.041
is always with you. Think about this –

64
00:03:46.041 --> 00:03:50.666
when you share your knowledge with others,

65
00:03:50.666 --> 00:03:54.500
what is your intention?

66
00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:58.750
Do you want to impress others,

67
00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:05.000
or do you truly want to help them?

68
00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:08.125
Just as a mathematician

69
00:04:08.125 --> 00:04:10.375
who does not teach his complete knowledge

70
00:04:10.375 --> 00:04:13.791
to his students,

71
00:04:13.791 --> 00:04:15.916
he does not truly honour

72
00:04:15.916 --> 00:04:18.875
his own talent.

73
00:04:18.875 --> 00:04:22.583
Knowledge that is not shared

74
00:04:22.583 --> 00:04:25.041
remains incomplete.

75
00:04:25.041 --> 00:04:29.125
Just as I, for your benefit,

76
00:04:29.125 --> 00:04:33.416
describe My glories,

77
00:04:33.416 --> 00:04:35.625
in the same way, you too.

78
00:04:35.625 --> 00:04:38.083
Whatever you have,

79
00:04:38.083 --> 00:04:41.166
share it not to seek praise,

80
00:04:41.166 --> 00:04:45.750
but with a genuine spirit of service.

81
00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:50.166
When your focus is on another's growth,

82
00:04:50.166 --> 00:04:53.541
then your own heart with compassion

83
00:04:53.541 --> 00:04:57.083
and humility fills.

84
00:04:57.083 --> 00:05:00.083
This true spirit of sharing

85
00:05:00.083 --> 00:05:04.708
not only deepens relationships, but

86
00:05:04.708 --> 00:05:11.041
gives inner richness to all.

87
00:05:11.041 --> 00:05:13.791
In service lies true joy –

88
00:05:13.791 --> 00:05:17.375
in selfishness, only sorrow.

89
00:05:21.875 --> 00:05:24.041
In your family –

90
00:05:24.041 --> 00:05:26.916
what do you do,

91
00:05:26.916 --> 00:05:28.708
what do you seek from your loved ones

92
00:05:28.708 --> 00:05:33.000
and what do you give?

93
00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:37.583
True love does not always mean giving

94
00:05:37.583 --> 00:05:39.333
what is being asked for.

95
00:05:39.333 --> 00:05:41.875
Love means –

96
00:05:41.875 --> 00:05:46.666
understanding their many unspoken needs,

97
00:05:46.666 --> 00:05:51.791
and then doing what is best for them.

98
00:05:51.791 --> 00:05:53.333
See,

99
00:05:53.333 --> 00:05:57.500
this is what I am doing with Arjun.

100
00:05:57.500 --> 00:06:00.916
I am not speaking for My own praise,

101
00:06:00.916 --> 00:06:03.750
but I am speaking for this

102
00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:08.333
that this knowledge will uplift him.

103
00:06:08.333 --> 00:06:10.791
Just as a mother knows

104
00:06:10.791 --> 00:06:14.500
that a child, rather than sweets,
needs nourishing

105
00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:19.333
food – in the same way, you too think.

106
00:06:19.333 --> 00:06:21.416
As a parent,

107
00:06:21.416 --> 00:06:25.291
as a sibling, as an elder,

108
00:06:25.291 --> 00:06:30.208
what can you offer?

109
00:06:30.208 --> 00:06:33.666
Not only what is asked for,

110
00:06:33.666 --> 00:06:35.250
but also that

111
00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:38.416
which truly should be given.

112
00:06:38.416 --> 00:06:42.625
Sometimes a child constantly seeks approval,

113
00:06:42.625 --> 00:06:46.916
but what they truly need

114
00:06:46.916 --> 00:06:50.166
is guidance.

115
00:06:50.166 --> 00:06:53.958
A family member may seek comfort,

116
00:06:53.958 --> 00:06:58.833
but what they need is courage –

117
00:06:58.833 --> 00:07:02.333
the courage to face challenges.

118
00:07:02.333 --> 00:07:05.666
What is true love?

119
00:07:05.666 --> 00:07:09.291
For someone's complete wellbeing

120
00:07:09.291 --> 00:07:14.583
the strength to go beyond momentary wishes.

121
00:07:14.583 --> 00:07:16.500
When you with this deeper

122
00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:20.250
understanding act,

123
00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:23.125
then you nourish not only relationships,

124
00:07:23.125 --> 00:07:26.125
but also the hearts

125
00:07:26.125 --> 00:07:29.375
and minds of those

126
00:07:29.375 --> 00:07:32.958
whom you love.

127
00:07:32.958 --> 00:07:34.291
Try it and see.

128
00:07:39.083 --> 00:07:41.625
Reflect on this.

129
00:07:41.625 --> 00:07:43.166
At the workplace,

130
00:07:43.166 --> 00:07:46.958
what is true leadership?

131
00:07:46.958 --> 00:07:49.333
Is it just authority

132
00:07:49.333 --> 00:07:53.375
and giving orders? No.

133
00:07:53.375 --> 00:07:54.375
True leadership

134
00:07:54.375 --> 00:07:57.708
is not keeping knowledge to yourself.

135
00:07:57.708 --> 00:08:02.625
It is sharing your experience
for others' growth, sharing it.

136
00:08:02.625 --> 00:08:07.083
Offering your insight to others.

137
00:08:07.083 --> 00:08:11.583
When I give teachings to Arjun,

138
00:08:11.583 --> 00:08:15.500
it is not to impress him,

139
00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:19.208
but to guide him,

140
00:08:19.208 --> 00:08:23.458
to help him move forward in his life,

141
00:08:23.458 --> 00:08:30.208
and amid challenges, clarity to provide.

142
00:08:30.208 --> 00:08:32.083
This is the spirit

143
00:08:32.083 --> 00:08:35.625
of 'hita-kamyaya' –

144
00:08:35.625 --> 00:08:38.458
acting from the pure resolve

145
00:08:38.458 --> 00:08:41.291
to help others.

146
00:08:41.291 --> 00:08:44.875
Just as one who knows the path of the forest

147
00:08:44.875 --> 00:08:48.625
shows the way to travellers – in the same way,

148
00:08:48.625 --> 00:08:52.625
you too reflect on your own journey.

149
00:08:52.625 --> 00:08:56.958
The lessons you have learned,
the skills you have developed,

150
00:08:56.958 --> 00:08:59.708
the knowledge gained from failures,

151
00:08:59.708 --> 00:09:01.916
the understanding gained from successes –

152
00:09:01.916 --> 00:09:04.708
all these for others

153
00:09:04.708 --> 00:09:07.375
can be a source of inspiration.

154
00:09:07.375 --> 00:09:12.541
Share them with your team.

155
00:09:12.541 --> 00:09:15.458
Pass them on to colleagues.

156
00:09:15.458 --> 00:09:19.500
Guide the new members.

157
00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:24.458
This builds an environment of growth and trust.

158
00:09:24.458 --> 00:09:26.875
Remember,

159
00:09:26.875 --> 00:09:29.208
by helping others

160
00:09:29.208 --> 00:09:32.875
your success is not diminished.

161
00:09:32.875 --> 00:09:36.666
This builds strong bonds of trust.

162
00:09:36.666 --> 00:09:42.541
For all, a better environment it creates.

163
00:09:42.541 --> 00:09:46.208
When you work with a genuine heart,

164
00:09:46.208 --> 00:09:50.000
with the spirit of upliftment,

165
00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:53.541
then your leadership for all

166
00:09:53.541 --> 00:09:56.625
becomes a source of inspiration,

167
00:09:56.625 --> 00:09:59.375
a source of meaning.
